@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed — Concrete quality scenario and evidence contract
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Source\nAuthorized viewer / competing owner change" as S
rectangle "Stimulus\nExact private representation request\nwhile link/grant/mode changes" as T
rectangle "Artifact\nSharing / Identity / Files serving boundary" as A
rectangle "Environment\nConcurrent change; warm or cold cache\nactual selected candidate and mechanism" as E
rectangle "Response\nOnly current permitted exact content admitted\ntruthful denial / unavailable; no private fallback" as R
rectangle "Response measure\nActual admission/revocation ordering\npermitted vs prohibited byte observations\nlatency/errors recorded separately" as M
S --> T
T --> A
E --> A : scenario context
A --> R
R --> M
note bottom of M
 QA-01 example, not a test result or accepted numerical target.
 Already emitted bytes cannot be recalled.
 Fast responses cannot offset unauthorized disclosure.
end note

@enduml